{"context":{"today":"2026-10-02","user":{"first_name":"Marta","plata_plus":false},"credit_statement":{"cut_off_date":"2026-09-05","next_cut_off_date":"2026-10-05","due_date":"2026-09-28","no_interest_payment":13500.0,"minimum_payment":1875.0,"total_debt":18750.0,"paid_this_period":0.0,"annual_rate":0.48,"overdue_days":4,"msi_plans":[]}},"conversation":[{"role":"user","content":"I missed a credit card payment — what will happen to me and what do I need to do now?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"You have a total debt of 18,750 MXN; the payment to avoid interest on the current statement is 13,500 MXN; minimum payment — 1,875 MXN. Your statement is dated 2026-09-05, the payment was due by 2026-09-28, there is now a delinquency of 4 days and no payments were received during this period.

What happens next: if you make only the minimum payment, interest will begin to accrue on the remaining balance; if the minimum is not paid, this is considered a default — fees may apply and data may be reported to the credit bureau.

To limit the consequences, try to make at least the minimum payment as soon as possible via the [payments screen](lnk_payments). Would you like me to prepare the exact amount and the transfer details?"}]}

